    {
      "fileName": "lost-in-the-crowd.json",
      "id": "d8RfatiK9UOQANLz",
      "name": "Lost in the Crowd",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "d8RfatiK9UOQANLz",
        "folder": "bviEMqBLpX2bzyPl",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Lost in the Crowd",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've learned how to move as one with crowds and hide among them, vanishing into a busy street in the flicker of an eye. You move at full Speed in crowds and can use cover from crowds to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak], gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Stealth checks when in a crowd of at least 10 creatures and a +4 circumstance bonus to your Stealth checks when in a crowd of at least 100 creatures.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Lost in the Crowd]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
